Open Vanilla 0034: Duels arrives ready. Specs: OpenVanilla.Specs (2-4), OpenVanilla.Specs.SwitchSeconds (0: at
once), OpenVanilla.Specs.Templates (spec n is talent tree n, named after it; a spec never used gets that tree's
PvP build, as does a new character's first spec: their points are spent for them; a tree with no build is
filled tier by tier). "SP <active>,<count>,<seconds>;<names...>" and "SN <spec>,<fresh>" after a switch (fresh:
no bars of its own yet). No switching during a match. Gear: on Duels every gear set of the class can be put
in the bags ("wf kitbags": "WK bags,<given>,<no room>"), a set goes on from the bags and the pieces it
replaces go back into them, and gear can change while queued. Consumables: each class's own on top of the
shared ones (OpenVanilla.Duels.Consumables.<Class>), up to 1000 of one item (ammo).

